{"unit_id":"tag:03DR:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节的结果表明，概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>上的拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent modules）的范畴（category），与拓扑（topologies）一章中与<MATH_0002>相关的许多位点（sites）上的拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent modules）的范畴（category）之间存在自然的（natural）等价（equivalence）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0003>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0004>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0005>-模（module）。考虑函子（functor）\n<MATH_0006>\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent modules","target_term":"拟凝聚模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent modules","target_term":"拟凝聚模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"natural","target_term":"自然的"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"底概形，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent modules","target_term":"拟凝聚模","context":"本节比较的模，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"本节比较的范畴，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"相关章节主题，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"与概形相关的位点，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"natural","target_term":"自然的","context":"等价的自然性，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"两种模范畴之间的等价，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"所考虑模的性质，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"结构层上的模，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"显示公式定义的函子，词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
